{"file_id":"LANG_MYOUTER_STAFF_COMMENT.OLANG","resource_class":"STAGEDAT_OLANG","part":2,"range":"50-99","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":50,"cn_text":"“看看这个纹身。这些星星代表我经历过的战场数量。\n不过嘛，其实都是贴纸。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":109,"review_flag":"AUX_COOL_EXPANSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":51,"cn_text":"“我的名字是……算了。你想怎么叫就怎么叫吧。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":52,"cn_text":"“这里净是些笨蛋……所以我才这么喜欢这里。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":53,"cn_text":"“也分你一点我的好运。来，用我吧！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":54,"cn_text":"“扑克脸。这是我在这个世界上见识过的最强武器。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":55,"cn_text":"“昨天的敌人，今天成了伙伴吗……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":56,"cn_text":"“喂……别把我当新人啊，呼……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":57,"cn_text":"“等我攒够钱，就买房结婚……！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":58,"cn_text":"“Boss，MSF不是你一个人的。别忘了这一点！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":59,"cn_text":"“为了留在祖国的妻子和女儿，我得好好赚钱才行……\n……我做了这样的梦。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":106,"review_flag":"JPN_DREAM_TWIST_PRESERVED; AUX_OMISSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":60,"cn_text":"“这里的饭还挺不错。不过最好吃的还是妈妈做的。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":61,"cn_text":"“有个能回来的地方真好。跟着你来是对的。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"JPN_PLACE_TO_RETURN_CLAUSE_PRESERVED; AUX_TRUNCATION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":62,"cn_text":"“我好像见过一个和我长得一模一样的人……当然，只是毫无关系的长得像。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":63,"cn_text":"“把纸箱当垫脚台的话，也许一个人就能爬到高处……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":64,"cn_text":"“要是哪天我有女朋友了，真想和她一起钻进纸箱……\n享受只属于两个人的时间……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":115,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":65,"cn_text":"“收到补给时，要是送来的正好是当时最缺的东西，真的会让人感动得想哭。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":66,"cn_text":"“伙伴之间要互相搭话！\n不过，为了避免‘找不到该说什么！’这种情况，\n先在‘ENTRY GATE’里的‘CO-OPS COMM.’准备好吧！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":165,"review_flag":"JPN_FIXED_ENTRY_GATE_AND_CO-OPS_COMM_LABELS_PRESERVED; AUX_MISSION_PREP_SUBSTITUTION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":67,"cn_text":"“人员配置的铁则就是‘适材适所’。那么，我该去哪儿呢？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":68,"cn_text":"“士气高涨时，就能发挥出超出平时的能力。我要上了！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":69,"cn_text":"“扛着重武器跑可真累。跑步速度也会变慢……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":70,"cn_text":"“听说有一种几乎不会发出脚步声的战斗服。\n要真有那种东西，别人站在我背后我大概都察觉不到。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":136,"review_flag":"JPN_BEHIND_ME_PERSPECTIVE_PRESERVED; AUX_SNEAKING_USE_PARAPHRASE_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":71,"cn_text":"“不管多大的大型兵器都应该有弱点……我不会放弃！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"JPN_WONT_GIVE_UP_CLAUSE_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":72,"cn_text":"“就算晕过去了，被反复拍几下当然也会醒啊！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":73,"cn_text":"“我的梦想是开发一种‘从远处开枪也能进行富尔顿回收的武器’……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":74,"cn_text":"“我喜欢‘M10’……\n因为射速快，而且‘AUTO AIM’的有效距离也很长。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":75,"cn_text":"“用‘Analyzer’就能挑出优秀士兵并把他们招集起来……\n这很合理……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":76,"cn_text":"“啊，好想喝点好喝的碳酸饮料……那样的话就能打起精神了……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":77,"cn_text":"“人不能不吃饭。\n出任务时连食物都忘了带，除非对自己特别有自信，否则可不行……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":118,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":78,"cn_text":"“端起狙击步枪时，不要着急，花点时间集中精神。\n真的……能感觉到晃动慢慢稳定下来了！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":127,"review_flag":"JPN_SWAY_SETTLES_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED; AUX_DEEP_BREATH_HANDS_EXPANSION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":79,"cn_text":"“要是研发继续进步，变成透明人也许就不再只是梦想……呵呵。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"JPN_DEVELOPMENT_PROGRESS_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":80,"cn_text":"“眩晕手雷扔出去后得马上别过脸，不然自己的眼睛也会遭殃……\n说得太对了，Boss！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":81,"cn_text":"“麻醉枪的效果会根据命中部位不同而变化……让我看看？呃……ZZZ……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":82,"cn_text":"“头盔碍事的时候就开枪把它打飞。\n最好在对方警戒起来之前打中，对吧？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":83,"cn_text":"“我见过被俘虏的女兵。\n我没能救她……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":84,"cn_text":"“Boss，也让我去参加‘EXTRA OPS’吧！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":85,"cn_text":"“‘香蕉除了吃之外还有别的用途。’……这是我曾祖父的遗言。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"JPN_GREAT_GRANDFATHER_LAST_WORDS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":86,"cn_text":"“如果想把消耗道具或弹药交给CO-OPS中的伙伴，\n就在武器、装备品窗口里选中后DROP……\n这是Boss说过的话里，最让我印象深刻的一句。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":181,"review_flag":"JPN_CO-OPS_DROP_INSTRUCTION_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":87,"cn_text":"“要是有更强的武器，我想我们也能发挥得更好。\n继续开发新武器吧！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":88,"cn_text":"“迷路的时候只要看‘MAP’，上面标着出口，真是帮大忙了。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":89,"cn_text":"“在‘ENTRY GATE’里，不光武器和道具，\n连战斗服也得注意选择，对吧，Boss！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"JPN_ENTRY_GATE_LABEL_PRESERVED; AUX_MISSION_PREP_SUBSTITUTION_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":90,"cn_text":"“如果对接下来的任务没信心，就先专心招募人员、开发武器装备……\n原来如此，就是绝不能急着往前赶！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":145,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":91,"cn_text":"“原来如此……GMP就是MSF收入的总和……\n就像国家的GNP（国民生产总值）一样啊……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":115,"review_flag":"JPN_GNP_NATIONAL_PRODUCT_TERM_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":92,"cn_text":"“身上有好闻的气味，会很受女性欢迎哦！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"JPN_GOOD_SMELL_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED; AUX_SUCCESS_SMELL_PUN_REJECTED"},{"unique_index":93,"cn_text":"“Boss！谢谢你一直听我们说这些话。\n偶尔也会有些有用的情报吧！？”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":"JPN_USEFUL_INFORMATION_SEMANTICS_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":94,"cn_text":"“换弹时会露出破绽。\n换弹的时机和开枪的时机一样重要……对吧，Boss！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":95,"cn_text":"“Boss，请教我怎么换弹！\n……哦！原来是装备武器后按动作按钮！\n谢谢你，Boss！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":112,"review_flag":"JPN_ACTION_BUTTON_LITERAL_TEXT_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":96,"cn_text":"“再难的任务，两个人也许就能想办法解决！\n我去找个能组成双人小组、一起并肩作战的伙伴！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":130,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":97,"cn_text":"“训练时我被CQC撞到墙上，昏迷了一阵子。\n感觉比平时‘疼了一倍’……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":98,"cn_text":"“Boss，要是我倒在战场上，请把我救活！\n但别用嘴对嘴人工呼吸！”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":99,"cn_text":"“连续CQC最重要的是时机啊。\n得再冷静一点按下去……”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""}]}